sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant S as Servidor
  participant A as Atacante
  participant F as Falsificado
  Note over C,S: Normal
  C->>S: SYN
  S->>C: SYN-ACK
  C->>S: ACK
  Note over A,F: Flood
  A->>S: SYN em nome de F
  S->>F: SYN-ACK
  Note over F: Sem resposta
  Note over S: Fila cheia
  C->>S: SYN
  Note over C: Sem resposta
